"attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:yuanshi","source:mingshi"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-fae62374c7b77d77","query":"宋哲宗","count":1,"offset":4154,"excerpt":"，共十有八。所謂儲者，非夾室與？唐貞觀故事，遷廟之主，藏於夾室西壁，南北三間。又宋哲宗亦嘗於東夾室奉安，後雖增建一室，其夾室仍舊。是唐、宋夾室，與諸室制度無大異也。五帝不相沿樂，三王不相襲禮。今廟制皆不合古，權宜一時。宜取今廟一十五間，南北六間，","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-3a35ee995b59c746","query":"宋哲宗","count":1,"offset":6715,"excerpt":"八月，河南進玉璽。忠賢欲侈其事，命由大明門進，行受璽禮，百僚表賀。尊素上言：「昔宋哲宗得璽，蔡確等競言祥瑞，改年元符，宋祚卒不競。本朝弘治時，陜西獻玉璽，止令取進，給賞五金。此祖宗故事，宜從。」事獲中止。五年春，遣視陜西茶馬。甫出都，逆黨曹欽程劾","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":2,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:yuanshi-fae62374c7b77d77","bookId":"book:yuanshi","requestedTitle":"元史/卷074","title":"元史/卷074","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%85%83%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7074","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2258479","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%85%83%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7074?action=history","revisionId":2258479,"revisionTimestamp":"2023-02-01T09:31:56Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:57:10.299Z","sha256":"08b3c1b0a16a27cf63805691b282c7f2db50f454c20969cde39a9f8d005362e3","textSha256":"ef3ffb8e208bf9e96cac7a018df8fbe97c49ffd25601d3cc2f1f0c7c23ab4ea1","expandedWikitextSha256":"08b3c1b0a16a27cf63805691b282c7f2db50f454c20969cde39a9f8d005362e3","characters":13653,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/yuanshi.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for app